/work` 的请求确实返回了 HTTP 500 响应（见证据 #5）。\n- **状态层**：Kubernetes 状态直接观测到容器以非零退出码 2 终止（见证据 #1, #2）。\n\n**未确认细节：**\n导致初始 HTTP 500 的具体业务逻辑缺陷、依赖故障或代码上下文未在采集范围内（见正式 RCA 中的 `unknowns`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 75.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8: 75.8s (Evidence 64.6s, RCA 11.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-n5vp8**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 107.999, "metrics": {"run_id": "7401db44b36847fa", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.00486850738525, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {